  "notes": [
    {
      "url": "https://substack.com/@howwecityaar/note/c-374962936",
      "date": "2026-10-31T11:53:51.326000+00:00",
      "body": "I have made peace with the chaos within me. Some days, I am the storm. Some days, I am merely a creature trying to remember how to be gentle.\n\nAnd on most days, I am neither. I am just here, making a little nonsense of it all.🕸️",
      "images": [
        "https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_jpg,w_1000,c_limit/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F43b699aa-6d42-478e-b30e-be0bb58e6d05_896x886.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "url": "https://substack.com/@howwecityaar/note/c-374960696",
      "date": "2026-10-31T11:49:36.429000+00:00",
      "body": "ਵੇ ਮੈਂ ਚੜ੍ਹਕੇ ਮੁਸੱਲੇ ਸੱਤ ਅਸਮਾਨਾਂ ਦੇ ਥੱਲੇ ਜੇ ਤੂੰ ਆਖੇਂ ਤਾਂ ਢੋਲਾ ਜਿੰਦ ਵਾਰ ਦਿੰਦੀ ਹਾਂ\n\nਮੂੰਹ ਕਾਅਬੇ ਨੂੰ ਕਰ ਲੈ ਐਤਬਾਰ ਦਿੰਦੀ ਹਾਂ ਮੂੰਹ ਕਾਅਬੇ ਨੂੰ ਕਰ ਲੈ ਐਤਬਾਰ ਦਿੰਦੀ ਹਾਂ\n\nBut I think I've spent enough of my life trying to prove how much I can give, how far I can go, and how much I can endure. Even to myself. There's always another sky to climb, another mountain to move, another impossible thing to accomplish just so I can feel worthy of the life I'm living.\n\nAnd lately, I find myself disagreeing with that kind of devotion. I don't want to keep making grand sacrifices at the altar of my own expectations. I want to stop treating my existence like something I have to constantly justify. Maybe there's something beautiful about simply being here, without having to offer the whole universe as proof of it.",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "url": "https://substack.com/@howwecityaar/note/c-374956550",
      "date": "2026-10-31T11:42:02.854000+00:00",
      "body": "Do not be envious of someone’s joy. it might be their first time to breathe out after their lungs were drenched in sorrow for too long :)",
      "images": []
    },
