      "date": "2026-09-18T14:24:25.914000+00:00",
      "body": "There's a minute right before the cab drops me off when I think-don't stop, take me anywhere else.\n\nJust keep driving!\n\nI have it all wrong.\n\nI have it all wrong but I'm somehow alive.🌐",
