      "date": "2026-09-14T03:12:19.763000+00:00",
      "body": "If you're in your 20’s , physically fit, hungry to learn and be better. I urge you to travel- as far and as widely as possible. Sleep on floors if you have to. Find out how other people LIVE and EAT and COOK.\n\nLearn from them-wherever you go.🐋",
